Reuse the existing secure server-side Gemini integration and fallback conventions.

Requirements:

- No frontend API keys.
- Input-size validation.
- Zod validation for requests and responses.
- Bounded API requests and retries.
- Safe error messages.
- No untrusted model output applied directly to persisted state.
